# Allowlist, not a denylist: worlds/ alone is ~100 MB per imported map and the
# exporter's .cache/ is larger still, so "everything, minus what we remember to
# name" is the wrong way round here. Name what a build needs instead.
*

!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/tsconfig.base.json
!/packages

# Re-excluded under packages/: the host's node_modules are the wrong platform's
# binaries, and dist/ is built inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/tests
